# Raw captures from the live schema sweep (tools/schema-sweep). These are
# redacted on write, but redaction is a curated key list and cannot be
# complete, so the payloads are reviewed by eye before any of them are
# copied into docs/ or test/support/. Ignored so that a routine `git add -A`
# after a live run cannot commit an unreviewed charger serial or location.
schema-sweep-output*/
*.log
.DS_Store
